5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry about who sits beside whom. It shapes our whole week.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"We should decide who gets the worse spots, not let it happen by accident.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I am worried about the cost. The budget has not changed in years.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,My mornings are already tight. I need to know how long setup takes.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Comfort matters. I sit here all day. The chair and noise level are key.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Toshio, yes. We need to be fair about the bad seats.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Shizue, agreed. We must name the trade-offs clearly.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Mio, setup time is part of the cost too, in a way.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Daisuke, exactly. Every minute lost is a minute not working.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,I will look into the physical comfort aspects.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I want to see the plan against what people actually want.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will check the history of past changes.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I need to see the billing basis for the floor.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mio,,I will check the morning routine on the pilot floor.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will look at the sound readings and the physio note.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,Let us see what the data says before we move anything.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,Agreed. Facts first.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,Please. I do not want to guess.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Mio,,I am ready to look.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
