31,2,,status,Mio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
32,2,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
33,2,,status,Toshio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
34,2,,status,Shizue,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Shizue,,The survey says daylight is the biggest complaint. The plan gives only four windows.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"Badge records show arrival times vary wildly. First-come, first-served is unfair.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"We are billed for area, not people. Empty desks still cost us 41,000 yen a month.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Mio,,The pilot floor took up to nine minutes to set up. That is huge for my gaps.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,The printer side is nine decibels louder. My chair takes days to adjust properly.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Daisuke, that billing fact is scary. We are paying for empty space.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Mio, nine minutes is too long. We need a system that minimizes that.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shizue, yes. We need to be efficient with the space we pay for.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, I agree. Fixed desks might help, but only if they are good.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,I need a quiet spot. The window side is better for sound.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"If we rotate, we might share the good and bad spots fairly.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"Rotation could work, but it causes shuffles. We had two bad ones last year.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"Shuffles cost money. Facilities charge 6,200 yen per desk move.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Mio,,That is expensive. We should avoid moving desks often.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"If we rotate, I get to try different spots. But the noise is a problem.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shizue,,Maybe fixed desks by function? That keeps people with similar work together.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,That sounds stable. But who gets the window?,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,We need to assign the windows carefully.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Mio,,I want a spot that is easy to set up.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,I want a quiet spot.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
