60,3,1,talk,Shizue,,Option A is too chaotic. Option B is stable. Option C is fair but costly.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Option B seems best. We can assign the windows to those who need them.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Option B avoids the 6,200 yen move fees. It is the most economical.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Mio,,Option B means I set up once. That saves my morning gaps.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Option B lets me pick a quiet spot. I can adjust my chair once.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Shizue,,I agree with Option B. It feels right for the team.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Toshio,,I vote for B. It is the most predictable.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,I vote for B. It saves money.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Mio,,I vote for B. It saves time.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,I vote for B. It saves my back.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Shizue,,It seems we are all leaning toward B.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Toshio,,Yes. Let us confirm.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I am comfortable with B.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Mio,,I am happy with B.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,I am ready for B.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Shizue,,Let us vote.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
